<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres sees 1997 net rising.</title>
<headline>Benpres sees 1997 net rising.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benpres Holdings Corp said on Thursday it expects its net income in 1997 to reach 2.69 billion pesos compared with 2.01 billion the previous year.</p>
<p>Benpres projected revenues to amount to 3.29 billion pesos versus 2.24 billion in 1996.</p>
</text>
